WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.118
To record observations by filling a questionnaire,

1.2
00:00:03.118 --> 00:00:07.978
open the patient's encounter from your facility, and go to the Overview tab.

2.1
00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:11.799
In the quick actions on the Overview tab, select Forms.

2.2
00:00:11.799 --> 00:00:16.779
Care opens a list of questionnaires with the search box Search Forms.

3.1
00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:18.654
Choose the questionnaire.

3.2
00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:23.008
Type part of its title in Search Forms, then select it in the list,

3.3
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:26.562
here Vital Signs. Care opens the questionnaire.

4.1
00:00:26.562 --> 00:00:31.933
Answer the questions. A question with an asterisk after its text is required.

4.2
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:35.457
If a question has a unit, the unit shows in brackets,

4.3
00:00:35.457 --> 00:00:41.176
so enter the number in that unit.

5.1
00:00:41.176 --> 00:00:42.660
Select Save Changes.

5.2
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.671
Care records an observation for each coded question you answered,

5.3
00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.892
and returns you to the Overview tab,

5.4
00:00:48.892 --> 00:00:52.353
where the new values appear in the Vitals panel.
